### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### 2. Get all items
GET http://localhost:3001/api/items

### 3. Get one existing item
GET http://localhost:3001/api/items/1

### 4. Get a missing item (Should return 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/items/999

### 5. Create a new item (Valid - Should return 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "4K Video Camera",
  "category": "Video",
  "location": "Studio B",
  "condition": "Excellent",
  "dailyPrice": 25,
  "available": true
}

### 6. Create an item with missing data (Invalid - Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken Request Missing Category and Price"
}

### 7. Update item availability (PATCH - Should return 200 OK)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": false
}

### 8. Delete an item by ID (DELETE - Should return 200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/items/1